      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ANOTHER IDEA (3) is a promising dog in the frame at 34 of 75 starts including 16 wins and was in the minors again latest (30.06) over 520m at Q Parklands. Form at the trip sound including 13 wins. Looks well placed here and should prove hard to beat again. MORE THAN MERRY (1) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (22.12) at Q Lakeside behind Hope's Jacky in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. Bold showing expected. RED ROCK RAZZLE (6) was a Grade 4/5 winner two back then out of the placings latest at Taree Super Track but moves to Box 6 this time where he has performed well. Expecting significant improvement this line-up. RICKY BOBBY (2) missed the placings here last start but is well-placed to make amends.",
